@catalog = http://localhost:8081
@sellerId = 7

### T07-01 创建草稿
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products
X-Seller-Id: {{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":8,"name":"演示商品","description":"安全商品","category":"DIGITAL","price":99.00,"stock":3}

### 卖家商品列表
GET {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products
X-Seller-Id: {{sellerId}}

### 提交审核（将 1 替换为实际商品 ID）
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products/1/actions/SUBMIT
X-Seller-Id: {{sellerId}}

### 审核通过（内部接口）
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/internal/products/1/risk-decision
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true}

### 下架商品
POST {{catalog}}/api/catalog/seller/products/1/actions/OFF_SHELF
X-Seller-Id: {{sellerId}}
